<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Ecology Tree Service" description="Privacy policy for the Ecology Tree Service website.">
  <article class="legal"><div class="narrow"><p class="section-label">Website policy</p><h1>Privacy</h1><p>Ecology Tree Service respects the privacy of people who contact the company through this website.</p><h2>Information you provide</h2><p>If you call, email, or submit the estimate request form, we receive the information you choose to provide, such as your name, contact details, property address, timing, access conditions, nearby concerns, and description of requested work. We use it to respond to your inquiry, assess scheduling, and provide service. Estimate requests are stored securely so they are not lost if an email notification is delayed.</p><h2>Website data</h2><p>The public website is hosted and protected by Cloudflare. Cloudflare may process technical information needed to deliver and secure the site, such as IP address, browser information, request logs, and the security signals used by Cloudflare Turnstile, under its own privacy practices.</p><h2>Sharing</h2><p>We do not sell personal information. Information may be shared with service providers when reasonably necessary to operate the website or respond to a service request, or when required by law.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href="mailto:info@ecologytreeservice.com">info@ecologytreeservice.com</a> or directed to <a href="tel:+19142429892">(914) 242-9892</a>.</p><p><small>Last updated: August 31, 2026.</small></p></div></article>
</BaseLayout>
